  "doc": {
    "description": "12 -- DLatch: a gated (level-sensitive) D latch built on SRLatch.\n\nWhile EN is high, Q follows D; while EN is low, the latch holds its\nlast value.  Composing a sequential component is no different from a\ncombinational one -- the state is just feedback inside the instance,\nand SRLatch's init seeds carry through flattening.",
